### LAYER 2: Dealer Site Ingestion (STRONG MANUS CANDIDATE)
Currently uses Firecrawl with structured extraction. Only 1 Firecrawl source remains, 8 already on Manus.

| Current Setup | Details |
|--------------|---------|
| Function | `dealer-site-ingest` (Firecrawl) + `dealer-site-crawl` |
| Crons | 3x daily (8AM, 12PM, 5PM AEST) + every 2h crawl |
| Sources table | `dealer_outbound_sources` (1 firecrawl, 8 manus) |
| Volume | ~500 listings across ~20 dealer_site:* sources |
| Issues | Firecrawl credit burn, JS-rendering failures, adapter maintenance |

**Consolidation opportunity:**
- Migrate the 1 remaining Firecrawl source to `adapter_type: manus`
- Replace `dealer-site-ingest` + `dealer-site-crawl` crons with a single `trigger-manus-search` cron that loops all manus sources
- `manus-webhook` already handles ingestion to `retail_listings`
- **Eliminates:** `dealer-site-ingest`, `dealer-site-crawl`, `enqueue-dealer-crawl`, `process-dealer-crawl-jobs`

